(Pocket a square, drill its corners, then park)
o100 sub
  G1 X#1 Y0 F200
  G1 X#1 Y#1
  G1 X0 Y#1
  G1 X0 Y0
o100 endsub

o200 sub
  G81 X#1 Y#2 Z-3 R1
  G80
o200 endsub

o300 sub
  G0 Z5
  G0 X0 Y0
o300 endsub

o<named_pass> sub
  G1 Z-1
o<named_pass> endsub

G21 G90
o100 call [20]
o200 call [0] [0]
o200 call [20] [20]
o<named_pass> call
o300 call
M2
